# Cloudflare Pages rewrite for dynamic charity slugs. Static export can only
# pre-render one fixed shell page for /charities/[slug] (see the comment in
# src/app/charities/[slug]/page.tsx for why) -- this rewrites any request
# under /charities/* to that shell (200 = rewrite, keeps the real URL in the
# browser bar) instead of 404ing. Real static assets (the shell itself, the
# /charities directory page) still resolve normally since Cloudflare checks
# for a matching file before applying this rule.
/charities/*  /charities/_shell  200
